Bathroom
This is the place where you poop. There is a toilet here also. The room is very cramped and hard to move around in. There is a closet here, though it's pretty impossible to open the closet door without first closing the bathroom door. Luckily, we're ignoring doors in this house, so don't worry about it. Besides, there's nothing in the closet, so we'll pretend that isn't here too. The shower is behind you.

You see a mirror up against the wall, with some writing on it.

>x toilet
Well, I suppose  this  is the place where you poop. It's a nasty old toilet that doesn't always flush properly.

>x closet
Hey, I said we're pretending this one isn't here, leave it alone.

>x shower
It's where you bathe, take showers, and all that stuff. The water doesn't stay hot long, so baths aren't that great. It does get hot enough on cold days to steam up the room. There are toy letters stuck to the shower wall.

>read shower
