>use toilet
Use? Did you say  "USE"!?!? . Look, I don't mean to go on a rant here, but this is an interactive fiction adventure game. You need to have a little bit better of a vocabulary than "use!" Look, I know you think it's pretty straightforward to use the toilet, but there's way to many ways to interpret that. Are you trying to  use it for it's intended purpose, or are you trying to bash something with it? Are you trying to open the toilet, or take it apart, or have it block a door, or for something to stand on? Be a little bit more specific, please!

