In the Clouds
You are actually walking on what appears to be solid clouds. They are spongy, as if they have just enough weight to hold you before you fall through- you'd better be careful. Below you it seems like there is some kind of construction site. To the east you see the gates of a large castle, and I do mean a LARGE castle. The door is like fifteen feet high- it looks like it was built for some kind of giant (or at the very least, a large ogre). From the inside of the castle, you can hear what sounds like harp music.

>e

Inside Giant's Castle
You have entered the castle of a tremendous giant. This place, despite being up in the clouds and being the house of a giant (giants being known to be barbaric), is very luxurious. A beautiful red carpet leads from the massive entryway down a hallway full of paintings, each bigger than you, depicting various figures. On a table (ten feet up), is a beautiful golden harp, shaped with a woman on the front of it, who seems animate. Next to her is a goose next to several jewelled eggs, all out of your reach, and a large horn of plenty. All are outside your reach. On the south side of the room is a large machine with various buttons and monitors.

One of the eggs seems to have fallen from its perch and is on the floor.

You can also see a giant here.

>x giant
He is easily fifteen feet tall. He has a scowl about him, more like a tyrant than a barbarian. He is wearing noble finery, gold rings, silver necklaces, and all manner of bling.

>x egg
It is a large egg encrusted with precious jewels, covered with fine gold inlay, and ornamented in lapis lazuli and mother-of-pearl. Unlike most eggs, this one is hinged and closed with a delicate looking clasp. The egg appears extremely fragile.

>x machine
It's hard to make out the details from down on the floor.

>x paintings
A variety of paintings adorn the wall. One has a warlock, summoning forth both a dragon and a dark shape against a fledgling enchanter, who feebly attempts to defend against them.

>g
A variety of paintings adorn the wall. One shows a lean and hungry gentleman with a stiletto and a leather bag, sneaking about in some kind of maze.

>g
A variety of paintings adorn the wall. One shows a beautiful woman in a brass bikini, held in a jail cell, on what appears to be some kind of alien spaceship.

>x harp
It's (or she's) about 3 feet tall. The harp portion is probably five feet tall, with the woman carved into the side. It's made out of solid gold, and the strings seem to vibrate magically when she speaks, yes speaks, for the woman part of the harp appears animate, though it doesn't look like she is capable of moving herself, though she seems to be able to move her arms and head about.

>x goose
It's a goose. In fact, it's about the only normal sized thing here. It's actually the size of a normal goose. Its white with a golden tint to it's feathers. It seems content sitting up there.

>x eggs
A series of decorative eggs goes around the top of the room on small stands, all jewelled with different jewels and various precious metals.

