Living Room
You are in the living room of the tiny white house. Toys are scattered all over the room, leaving the floor barely visible. This may be a good thing, because the carpet has numerous stains from recent (and not so recent) pet and baby traffic. The front door leads out to the west, and to the northeast there appears to be a hallway. On the southeast end of the room is a large L shaped couch, which takes up almost all of the south and west walls. A large entertainment center takes up most of the north wall, with half of it being a trophy case, and the other half holding a TV. A baby's high chair is set up in front of the couch, as if there was a recent attempt to feed a child. Stains on the couch and floor indicate that this was most likely an unsuccessful attempt. A large picture window in the west wall gives a view of the street. A closet occupies the northwest corner of the room.  The closet contains a vacuum cleaner.

You can see a crystal ball, a hammer, a remote control, a leaflet, a swirling tunnel of light and magic, a lantern and a sword here.

>enter tunnel
Forest Path
You have entered a crossroads in the middle of a forest. The paths go in various directions, from the northwest to the southeast, from the north to the south and southwest, from the west to the east. A large wooden sign seems to provide some direction, and a large beanstalk leads up into the clouds. It looks like it has handhelds and could be climbed. Something about the area here seems fantastic, almost cartoonish. The colors are very bright, and the sky almost looks painted on.

You can see a swirling tunnel of light and magic here.

>u

In the Clouds
You are actually walking on what appears to be solid clouds. They are spongy, as if they have just enough weight to hold you before you fall through- you'd better be careful. Below you it seems like there is some kind of construction site. To the east you see the gates of a large castle, and I do mean a LARGE castle. The door is like fifteen feet high- it looks like it was built for some kind of giant (or at the very least, a large ogre). From the inside of the castle, you can hear what sounds like harp music.

>e

Inside Giant's Castle
You have entered the castle of a tremendous giant. This place, despite being up in the clouds and being the house of a giant (giants being known to be barbaric), is very luxurious. A beautiful red carpet leads from the massive entryway down a hallway full of paintings, each bigger than you, depicting various figures. On a table (ten feet up), is a beautiful golden harp, shaped with a woman on the front of it, who seems animate. Next to her is a goose next to several jewelled eggs, all out of your reach, and a large horn of plenty. All are outside your reach. On the south side of the room is a large machine with various buttons and monitors.

You can see a giant here.

>show heart to giant
(the giant)
"How... How did you get that?" says the large giant, obviously afraid.

>break heart
You destroy the giant heart, beating at it until it stops throbbing and becomes just a worthless mass, which you throw away.
The large giant clutches his chest and collapses as you destroy the giant heart. You check him, and see that he is dead.

