It is a massive machine which takes up most of the south wall. It has a large monitor on it, along with twelve different buttons: blue spiral button, blue circle button, orange circle button, orange semi-circle button, gray square button, red circle button, The gray cloud-shaped button, white star button, white square button, black square button and yellow lightning-bolt shaped button.

>x monitor
