 This is a large construction site. It looks like someone started building three houses to start off a subdivision. The forest here has been cleared away, leaving a large clearing, levelled and planted with grass seed. Unfortunately it's not growing yet, so theres thick, rich earth here rather than grass. It is beautifully sunny out.
