>shoot witch
The witch's eyes widen as you point the gun in her direction. Thanks to your magic crown, her spells have proved useless against you. Nonetheless, she tries to wave her wand at you in desperation. "Frobizz! Frobozzle! Frobnoid!" she chants, before the bullet enters her face, killing her.

