>ask Dan about David Bowie
"From the research I've been able to gather about David Bowie, we're actually dealing with the actor, not the character from the movie Labyrinth. However, after playing the role of Gareth the Goblin king in that movie, David Bowie became secretly obsessed with the character. He started to study dark magic. Eventually he came to the realm of the actual Goblin King (on whom Labyrinth was based) and destroyed him, took over his realm, and took over his job. His powers are similar to that of the Goblin King in the movie. I guess, for all intents and purposes, we may as well be dealing with the Goblin King character."

"David Bowie has our son and is planning to turn him into a goblin. We have to hurry!"


