You look around. David Bowie and Danny are here, and Danny is still a little boy.  "So you have made it this far!" says David Bowie. He turns towards you. "I had won! I had trapped your husband in my dungeon and had the baby here. But then you came out of nowhere! Where did you learn such magic? Between casting spells, using magic potions, using magic wands, you are quite the powerful sorceress, despite having absolutely no magical training!" He turns to Dan. "You! You should be thanking the gods that she came to bail you out, for all the good it will do you now. I have the baby, and he will be a goblin. The both of you will die!"

